  title: Buddhist councils
  text: 'Four major councils preserved and debated the teachings: at Rajagriha after the Buddha''s death, at Vaishali about a century later, at Pataliputra under Ashoka, and in Kashmir under Kanishka, which is linked with the rise of Mahayana.'
